Sat Oct  3 16:09:00 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.6.0
  * Add support for OpenAPI 3.1.2: the "openapi" version field of
    v3.v3_1.OpenAPI now also accepts "3.1.2", the default is still
    "3.1.1"
  * Dropped support for end-of-life Python 3.8, Python 3.9 is now the
    minimum
  * Upstream migrated the build backend from poetry-core to hatchling
  * Runtime dependencies are unchanged, pydantic >= 1.8 is still the only
    one
  * No CVEs fixed in this range

